%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 0}
  m_Name: PlatformHints
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: ConsoleCards.Definitions:ConsoleCards.Definitions:HintLibraryDefinition
  entries:
  - stableId: platform.table-empty
    trigger: table.ready
    context: empty
    text: Open + TOOLBOX to put pieces on the table. The Base Box holds the platform's
      pieces (Console mats, cards, dice, boards, pawns); a Game Box holds one game's
      own pieces.
    kind: 0
    priority: 10
    maxShows: 2
  - stableId: platform.table-game
    trigger: table.ready
    context: game
    text: The rules card on the left says how to play. Press Change on a rule to
      propose a house rule; every player agrees with their own button.
    kind: 0
    priority: 10
    maxShows: 2
  - stableId: platform.place-console
    trigger: toolbox.placing
    context: Console
    text: A Console mat has two sides. Right-click it to flip it to the controller
      side or to Duplicate it. A card snaps to the slot with the same symbol.
    kind: 0
    priority: 5
    maxShows: 2
  - stableId: platform.place-board
    trigger: toolbox.placing
    context: GameBoard
    text: Drop a board against another and their edges join. Right-click a board
      to change its grid or the size of its spaces; cards snap to the spaces.
    kind: 0
    priority: 5
    maxShows: 2
  - stableId: platform.place-die
    trigger: toolbox.placing
    context: Die
    text: Drag a die and let go to roll it. Right-click a die to set it to a number;
      on a Console's D-pad arrow it snaps in place.
    kind: 0
    priority: 5
    maxShows: 2
  - stableId: platform.place-deck
    trigger: toolbox.placing
    context: Deck
    text: Right-click a deck for its menu, for example Draw to Hand or Shuffle.
    kind: 0
    priority: 5
    maxShows: 2
  - stableId: platform.drag-card
    trigger: drag.card
    context: 
    text: Drop a card near a slot, pile or board space and it snaps in. F flips a
      card; the wheel turns it.
    kind: 0
    priority: 3
    maxShows: 2
  - stableId: platform.undo
    trigger: undo.available
    context: 
    text: 'Every step can be undone: Ctrl+Z undoes and Ctrl+Y redoes, or use the
      arrows on the top bar.'
    kind: 0
    priority: 2
    maxShows: 2
  - stableId: platform.draw
    trigger: action.DrawCards
    context: 
    text: Drawn cards go to your Hand at the bottom of the screen. H shows or hides
      it.
    kind: 0
    priority: 2
    maxShows: 2
  - stableId: platform.flip-console
    trigger: action.FlipConsole
    context: 
    text: 'The back of the Console maps the controller: A, B, X and Y take cards,
      and a die on a D-pad arrow can be set to a number.'
    kind: 0
    priority: 2
    maxShows: 2
